5,56,Slow stop deceleration time setting,"Sets deceleration time for immediate stop deceleration stop deceleration processing.
This parameter will become valid when Pr6.10 (Function expansion setup) bit15 = 1.",167
5,57,Slow stop S-shape acceleration and deceleration setting,"Sets the S-shape time for immediate stop deceleration stop deceleration processing.
This parameter will become valid when Pr6.10(Function expansion setup) bit15 = 1.",165
5,66,Deterioration diagnosis convergence judgment time,Sets time for deemed convergence of real-time auto tuning load characteristics estimate when deterioration diagnosis warning function is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).,161
,,,"When the set value is 0, it will be set automatically inside the driver in accordance with Pr6.31(Real time auto tuning estimation speed).",138
,,,"* When Pr6.31(Real time auto tuning estimation speed) = 0, the deterioration diagnosis warning judgment for load characteristics estimate will be invalid.",154
5,67,Deterioration diagnosis mass ratio upper limit,"Sets the upper limit values for mass ratio estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1). ",219
,,,"* When the upper limit value is set at 10000 (max. value), judgment of the upper limit becomes invalid.",103
,,,"* If Pr5.67 (upper limit) <= Pr5.68 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,68,Deterioration diagnosis mass ratio lower limit,"Sets the lower limit values for mass ratio estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1). ",219
,,,"* When the lower limit value is set at 0 (min. value), judgment of the lower limit becomes invalid.",99
,,,"* If Pr5.67 (upper limit) <= Pr5.68 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,69,Deterioration diagnosis unbalanced load upper limit,"Sets the upper limit values for unbalanced load estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",223
,,,"* When the upper limit value is set at 1000 (max. value), judgment of the upper limit becomes invalid.",102
,,,"* If Pr5.69 (upper limit) <= Pr5.70 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,70,Deterioration diagnosis unbalanced load lower limit,"Sets the lower limit values for unbalanced load estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",223
,,,"* When the lower limit value is set at -1000 (min. value), judgment of the lower limit becomes invalid.",103
,,,"* If Pr5.69 (upper limit) <= Pr5.70 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,71,Deterioration diagnosis dynamic friction upper limit,"Sets the upper limit values for dynamic friction estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",224
,,,"* When the upper limit value is set at 1000 (max. value), judgment of the upper limit becomes invalid.",102
,,,"* If Pr5.71 (upper limit) <= Pr5.72 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,72,Deterioration diagnosis dynamic friction lower limit,"Sets the lower limit values for dynamic friction estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",224
,,,"* When the lower limit value is set at -1000 (min. value), judgment of the lower limit becomes invalid.",103
,,,"* If Pr5.71 (upper limit) <= Pr5.72 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,73,Deterioration diagnosis viscous friction upper limit,"Sets the upper limit values for viscous friction coefficient estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",236
,,,"* When the upper limit value is set at 1000 (max. value), judgment of the upper limit becomes invalid.",102
,,,"* If Pr5.73 (upper limit) <= Pr5.74 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,74,Deterioration diagnosis viscous friction lower limit,"Sets the lower limit values for viscous friction coefficient estimate in deterioration diagnosis judgment of load characteristics estimate after completion of convergence, when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1).",236
,,,"* When the lower limit value is set at 0 (min. value), judgment of the lower limit becomes invalid.",99
,,,"* If Pr5.73 (upper limit) <= Pr5.74 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.
* The set resolution shall be in units of 0.2%.",164
5,75,Deterioration diagnosis velocity setting,"Outputs deterioration diagnosis velocity output (V-DIAG) when the motor velocity is in the range of Pr5.75¡¾Pr4.35 (velocity coinciding width), when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit 1 =1).",208
,,,* Deterioration diagnosis velocity output has a 10 [mm/s] hysteresis.,69
5,76,Deterioration diagnosis thrust average time,Sets time required to compute the thrust command average (weighted frequency) when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1) and diagnosis velocity output (V-DIAG) is ON.,187
,,,* Time from diagnosis velocity output (V-DIAG) ON to the start judgment for upper and lower value of thrust command average value is also a part of the set time for this parameter.,180
,,,"* If the setting value is 0, the thrust command average value is not calculated.",80
5,77,Deterioration diagnosis thrust upper limit,Sets the upper limit values for thrust command average value when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1) and deterioration diagnosis velocity output (V-DIAG) is ON.,184
,,,"* When the upper limit value is set at 1000 (max. value), judgment of the upper limit becomes invalid.
* If Pr5.77 (upper limit) <= Pr5.78 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.",219
5,78,Deterioration diagnosis thrust lower limit,Sets the lower limit values for thrust command average value when deterioration diagnosis warning is valid (Pr6.97 bit1 = 1) and deterioration diagnosis velocity output (V-DIAG) is ON.,184
,,,"* When the lower limit value is set at -1000 (min. value), judgment of the lower limit becomes invalid.
* If Pr5.77 (upper limit) <= Pr5.78 (lower limit), judgment of both the upper limit and lower limit becomes invalid.",220
6,2,Velocity deviation excess setup,"Set threshold of Err24.1 (Speed deviation excess protection).
This protection is not detected when the setup value is 0.",120
6,5,Position 3rd gain valid time,Set up 3rd gain valid time of 3 gain level adjustment.,54
6,6,Position 3rd gain scale factor,Set up the 3rd gain by a multiplying factor of the 1st gain.,60
6,7,Thrust command additional value,"Set up the offset thrust to be added to the thrust command.
Notes) On real-time auto-gain tuning, it is set automatically.
 On manual setting, Please make the real-time auto-gain tuning invalid.",194
6,8,Positive direction thrust compensation value,"Set up the value to be added to the thrust command for positive direction operation.
Notes) On real-time auto-gain tuning valid, it is set automatically.
 On manual setting, Please make the real-time auto-gain tuning invalid.",225
6,9,Negative direction thrust compensation value,"Set up the value to be added to the thrust command for negative direction operation.
Notes) On real-time auto-gain tuning valid, it is set automatically.
 On manual setting, Please make the real-time auto-gain tuning invalid.",225
