 0:Disabled  1:Enabled",174
6,37,Oscillation detecting level,"Set up the oscillation detecting level.
Upon detection of a thrust vibration whose level is higher than this setup value, the oscillation detection alarm will be issued.
If the set value is 0, this function is disabled and the alarm is not activated.",250
6,38,Warning mask setup,"Set up the warning detection mask.
Placing 1 to the corresponding bit position disables detection of the warning condition.",123
6,39,Warning mask setup 2,"Set up the warning detection mask.
Placing 1 to the corresponding bit position disables detection of the warning condition.",123
6,41,1st damping depth,Specifies the damping depth of the 1st damping function.,56
