7,0,Display on LED,Select type of data displayed on front panel 7-seg LED.,55
7,1,Display time setup upon power-up,"Sets node address display time upon turning ON of control power.
When the setting value is 0 to 6, it is processed in 600ms. ",125
,,,"When the setting value is -1, a node address is shown from control power-on until the RTEX communication is established (communication and servo synchronization).",162
7,3,Output setup during thrust limit,"Set up judgment condition of output while thrust is limited by thrust control.
 0:Turn ON at thrust limit including thrust command value
 1:Turn ON at thrust limit excluding thrust command value",194
7,4,For manufacturer's use,0 Please fix.,13
